{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 第1课：文档加载与分块\n",
    "\n",
    "## 本节目标\n",
    "\n",
    "理解 RAG 的第一步——将外部知识转化为可检索的文本片段。你将学会：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **文档加载**：从网页抓取、下载 PDF/HTML 文档\n",
    "2. **文本解析**：从不同格式中提取纯文本\n",
    "3. **文本分块（Chunking）**：将长文档切分为适合检索的小片段\n",
    "4. **策略对比**：理解不同分块策略的优劣\n",
    "\n",
    "> 为什么需要分块？因为 Embedding 模型有输入长度限制（通常 512 tokens），同时太长的文本会导致检索精度下降——"大海捞针"变成了"大海捞船"。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 环境检查"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, '..')\n",
    "\n",
    "from config import config\n",
    "from src.document_loader import DocumentLoader\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"项目根目录: {config.project_root}\")\n",
    "print(f\"数据目录: {config.data_dir}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 文档加载\n",
    "\n",
    "`DocumentLoader` 负责获取知识源。它支持两种方式：\n",
    "- **在线模式**：从 CMU 课程网站抓取讲义\n",
    "- **离线模式**：使用内置的示例文档（10个经典机器学习主题）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 创建加载器实例\n",
    "loader = DocumentLoader()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 方式1：加载已缓存的文档（如果之前运行过）\n",
    "cached = loader.load_processed()\n",
    "if cached:\n",
    "    print(f\"从缓存加载了 {len(cached)} 篇文档\")\n",
    "    for doc in cached[:3]:\n",
    "        print(f\"  - {doc['source']} ({doc['length']} 字符)\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"未找到缓存，将创建示例数据...\")\n",
    "    docs = loader.run()  # 完整流程：抓取/创建 → 下载 → 解析 → 保存\n",
    "    print(f\"创建了 {len(docs)} 篇文档\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 探索文档内容\n",
    "\n",
    "看看每篇文档讲了什么。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "docs = loader.load_processed()\n",
    "print(f\"共 {len(docs)} 篇文档:\\n\")\n",
    "for doc in docs:\n",
    "    preview = doc['content'][:120].replace('\\n', ' ')\n",
    "    print(f\"【{doc['source']}】({doc['length']} 字符)\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  {preview}...\\n\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 文本分块（Chunking）\n",
    "\n",
    "这是 RAG 中最关键的工程决策之一。分块影响检索质量和 LLM 理解。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 三种策略\n",
    "\n",
    "| 策略 | 原理 | 优点 | 缺点 |\n",
    "|------|------|------|------|\n",
    "| **FixedTokenChunker** | 按固定 Token 数切片 | 简单可控 | 可能在句子中间截断 |\n",
    "| **RecursiveCharChunker** | 按段落→句子→词的优先级递归切分 | 保持语义完整性 | 块大小不均匀 |\n",
    "| **SemanticChunker** | 按句子边界切分，分组到阈值 | 保持句子完整 | 可能产生碎片 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from src.chunker import Chunker\n",
    "\n",
    "# 使用默认策略（递归字符）创建分块器\n",
    "chunker = Chunker(strategy=\"recursive_char\", chunk_size=512, chunk_overlap=50)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对文档进行分块\n",
    "chunks = chunker.chunk_documents(docs)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{len(docs)} 篇文档 → {len(chunks)} 个文本块\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n前3个块的示例:\")\n",
    "for i, chunk in enumerate(chunks[:3]):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n--- 块 {i+1} ---\")\n",
    "    print(f\"ID: {chunk['id']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"来源: {chunk['source']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"长度: {chunk['length']} 字符\")\n",
    "    print(f\"内容预览: {chunk['content'][:200]}...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 对比三种分块策略\n",
    "\n",
    "不同策略产生的块在数量、平均长度、标准差上有什么差异？"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "comparison = chunker.compare_strategies(docs)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{'策略':<20} {'块数':<8} {'平均长度':<12} {'最小长度':<10} {'最大长度':<10} {'标准差':<10}\")\n",
    "print(\"-\" * 70)\n",
    "for strategy, stats in comparison.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"{strategy:<20} {stats['num_chunks']:<8} {stats['avg_length']:<12.0f} \"\n",
    "          f\"{stats['min_length']:<10} {stats['max_length']:<10} {stats['std_length']:<10.0f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 块重叠（Overlap）的作用\n",
    "\n",
    "为什么需要重叠？想象一句关键的话刚好卡在分块边界上——前半个句子在一个块里，后半个在下一个块里。检索时可能两个块都匹配不上。\n",
    "\n",
    "**重叠让相邻块共享部分内容，减少边界信息丢失。**\n",
    "\n",
    "试试不同的 overlap 值："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "for overlap in [0, 50, 150]:\n",
    "    test_chunker = Chunker(strategy=\"recursive_char\", chunk_size=512, chunk_overlap=overlap)\n",
    "    test_chunks = test_chunker.chunk_documents(docs[:3])\n",
    "    avg_len = sum(c['length'] for c in test_chunks) / len(test_chunks) if test_chunks else 0\n",
    "    print(f\"overlap={overlap:3d}: {len(test_chunks)} 个块, 平均长度={avg_len:.0f} 字符\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 本节小结\n",
    "\n",
    "- 文档加载是 RAG 的入口，需要处理多种格式（PDF, HTML）\n",
    "- 分块策略直接影响检索效果：`recursive_char` 通常是最平衡的选择\n",
    "- 块大小和重叠是重要的超参数，需要根据文档类型和应用场景调优\n",
    "\n",
    "**下一步**：在 02 号笔记本中，我们将把这些文本块转化为向量嵌入并构建索引。"
   ]
  }
 ],
